WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.207
The children heard the lovely sound of a low horn.

2
00:00:06.208 --> 00:00:09.400
"What’s that?" asked Mandy.

3
00:00:09.401 --> 00:00:11.466
"It’s the hunting horn.

4
00:00:11.467 --> 00:00:15.539
The hunt is about to begin!" Helene yelled.

5
00:00:15.540 --> 00:00:18.089
"Everyone goes hunting with the king.

6
00:00:18.090 --> 00:00:21.845
Everyone but the servants, of course."

7
00:00:21.846 --> 00:00:25.201
A man with a pack of dogs appeared.

8
00:00:25.202 --> 00:00:29.345
The dogs were barking and pulling at their leashes.

9
00:00:29.346 --> 00:00:32.735
"What are they hunting?" asked Vinnie.

10
00:00:32.736 --> 00:00:36.535
"Most likely fox," Helene said.

11
00:00:36.536 --> 00:00:39.536
Another horn rang out.

12
00:00:39.537 --> 00:00:42.803
They heard horses trotting.

13
00:00:42.804 --> 00:00:46.880
"Do they hunt every day?" asked Mandy.

14
00:00:46.881 --> 00:00:49.453
"Of course!" said Helene.

15
00:00:49.454 --> 00:00:52.208
"Hunting is the king’s favorite sport.

16
00:00:52.209 --> 00:00:55.575
Yesterday he got a deer."

17
00:00:55.576 --> 00:00:58.219
Mandy burned with anger.

18
00:00:58.220 --> 00:01:02.751
She whispered to Vinnie, "Hunting is not a sport!

19
00:01:02.752 --> 00:01:05.817
It’s killing poor animals!"

20
00:01:05.818 --> 00:01:09.067
Helene took Mandy’s hand.

21
00:01:09.068 --> 00:01:15.908
"Since the king is out hunting, I’ll show you the palace," she said.

22
00:01:15.909 --> 00:01:20.616
The children all ran into the palace.

23
00:01:20.617 --> 00:01:23.733
"Ooh!" said Mandy.

24
00:01:23.734 --> 00:01:27.943
"Wow!" said Vinnie.

25
00:01:27.944 --> 00:01:30.623
"Shh!" said Helene.

26
00:01:30.624 --> 00:01:34.947
"If you want to see it all, you have to be quiet."

27
00:01:34.948 --> 00:01:38.071
Everything in the palace sparkled.

28
00:01:38.072 --> 00:01:42.343
Paintings of the king were on the walls and ceilings.

29
00:01:42.344 --> 00:01:47.540
The furniture was covered in gold and velvet.

30
00:01:47.541 --> 00:01:52.907
"There are about 700 rooms in Versailles," Helene explained.

31
00:01:52.908 --> 00:01:56.544
She stopped in front of huge double doors.

32
00:01:56.545 --> 00:01:59.007
Helene looked around.

33
00:01:59.008 --> 00:02:03.634
She wanted to make sure no one was watching.

34
00:02:03.635 --> 00:02:09.057
"And this room is the most beautiful of all!" cried Helene.

35
00:02:09.058 --> 00:02:11.219
"It’s my favorite!"

36
00:02:11.220 --> 00:02:15.563
She opened the double doors wide.

37
00:02:15.564 --> 00:02:18.933
Vinnie and Mandy followed her inside.

38
00:02:18.934 --> 00:02:21.336
Their mouths dropped open.

39
00:02:21.337 --> 00:02:26.557
It was a large hall.

40
00:02:26.558 --> 00:02:31.633
There were 17 glass doors that looked out to the gardens.

41
00:02:31.634 --> 00:02:37.194
On the walls were large decorated mirrors.

42
00:02:37.195 --> 00:02:39.294
"This is the Hall of Mirrors.

43
00:02:39.295 --> 00:02:44.087
It has 357 mirrors!" said Helene.

44
00:02:44.088 --> 00:02:47.604
"King Louis meets very important people in here.

45
00:02:47.605 --> 00:02:51.282
I make believe this is my dancing room."

46
00:02:51.283 --> 00:02:54.277
Helene twirled across the floor.

47
00:02:54.278 --> 00:02:59.204
She did not see two guards with long spears enter the hall.

48
00:02:59.205 --> 00:03:02.138
"You children!" one shouted.

49
00:03:02.139 --> 00:03:05.544
"In the name of His Royal Highness, stop!"

50
00:03:05.545 --> 00:03:09.354
"Uh-oh!" Helene stopped dancing.

51
00:03:09.355 --> 00:03:11.041
"Follow me!"

52
00:03:11.042 --> 00:03:14.539
Helene led the children down a hallway.

53
00:03:14.540 --> 00:03:19.371
Along the walls, gold statues held up crystal lights.

54
00:03:19.372 --> 00:03:22.217
"Stop!" yelled the other guard.

55
00:03:22.218 --> 00:03:24.654
The guards ran after them.

56
00:03:24.655 --> 00:03:28.303
"What happens if they catch us?" asked Vinnie.

57
00:03:28.304 --> 00:03:32.238
"Don’t worry," giggled Helene.

58
00:03:32.239 --> 00:03:34.732
"We can get away through the gardens.

59
00:03:34.733 --> 00:03:38.879
But we’ll have to hide first!"

60
00:03:38.880 --> 00:03:42.761
Helene turned a corner and went into a room.

61
00:03:42.762 --> 00:03:46.409
Lace and ostrich feathers were everywhere.

62
00:03:46.410 --> 00:03:49.186
A group of women sat sewing.

63
00:03:49.187 --> 00:03:53.070
One woman saw the children.

64
00:03:53.071 --> 00:03:57.743
"Are the guards chasing you again, Helene?" she smiled.

65
00:03:57.744 --> 00:04:00.612
Helene blew the woman a kiss.

66
00:04:00.613 --> 00:04:04.276
Then she led the children out another door.

67
00:04:04.277 --> 00:04:07.813
Helene ducked into another room.

68
00:04:07.814 --> 00:04:12.436
"How does she know this place so well?" gasped Mandy.

69
00:04:12.437 --> 00:04:14.826
Vinnie hurried right behind.

70
00:04:14.827 --> 00:04:17.618
He wondered the same thing.

71
00:04:17.619 --> 00:04:22.936
Suddenly, he bumped into a woman, and her head rolled off.

72
00:04:22.937 --> 00:04:28.931
"Ahhh!" he screamed.

